ng, tree),","+            None => merged.push(tree),","+        }","+    }","+    sort_trees(&mut merged);","+    merged","+}","+","+fn same_tree_key(left: &DependentsTree, right: &DependentsTree) -> bool {","+    left.name == right.name","+        && left.version == right.version","+        && left.peers_suffix_hash == right.peers_suffix_hash","+}","+","+fn merge_into_tree(target: &mut DependentsTree, source: DependentsTree) {","+    target.display_name = target.display_name.take().or(source.display_name);","+    target.path = target.path.take().or(source.path);","+    target.search_message = target.search_message.take().or(source.search_message);","+    target.manifest = target.manifest.take().or(source.manifest);","+    merge_dependent_nodes(&mut target.dependents, source.dependents);","+}","+","+fn merge_dependent_nodes(target: &mut Vec<DependentNode>, source: Vec<DependentNode>) {","+    for node in source {","+        match target.iter_mut().find(|existing| same_node_key(existing, &node)) {","+            Some(existing) => merge_into_node(existing, node),","+            None => target.push(node),","+        }","+    }","+    target.sort_by(|a, b| {","+        a.name","+            .cmp(&b.name)","+            .then_with(|| compare_versions(&a.version, &b.version))","+            .then_with(|| {","+                a.peers_suffix_hash","+                    .as_deref()","+                    .unwrap_or(\"\")","+                    .cmp(b.peers_suffix_hash.as_deref().unwrap_or(\"\"))","+            })","+    });","+}","+","+fn same_node_key(left: &DependentNode, right: &DependentNode) -> bool {","+    left.name == right.name","+        && left.version == right.version","+        && left.peers_suffix_hash == right.peers_suffix_hash","+        && left.dep_field == right.dep_field","+        && left.circular == right.circular","+}","+","+fn merge_into_node(target: &mut DependentNode, source: DependentNode) {","+    target.display_name = target.display_name.take().or(source.display_name);","+    target.manifest = target.manifest.take().or(source.manifest);","+    if let Some(node_deps) = source.dependents {","+        merge_dependent_nodes(target.dependents.get_or_insert_with(Vec::new), node_deps);","+        target.deduped = false;","+    } else if target.dependents.is_some() {","+        target.deduped = false;","+    }","+}"],"additions":86,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm11/deps/inspection/commands/src/listing/recursive.ts","lines":["@@ -1,7 +1,15 @@"," import assert from 'node:assert'"," ","-import { type Config, createProjectConfigRecord } from '@pnpm/config.reader'","-import { renderJson } from '@pnpm/deps.inspection.list'","+import { type Config, createProjectModulesDirResolver } from '@pnpm/config.reader'","+import {","+  type DependentsTree,","+  getDependentsTrees,","+  mergeDependentsTrees,","+  renderDependents,","+  renderJson,","+  whyForPackages,","+  type WhyOptions,","+} from '@pnpm/deps.inspection.list'"," import { isError } from '@pnpm/error'"," import { logger } from '@pnpm/logger'"," import type { IncludedDependencies, Project } from '@pnpm/types'","@@ -38,10 +46,10 @@ export async function listRecursive (","       lockfileDir: opts.lockfileDir,","     })","   }","-  const projectConfigRecord = createProjectConfigRecord(opts)","+  const resolveModulesDir = createProjectModulesDirResolver(opts)","   const projectOpts = ({ rootDir, manifest }: Project) => ({","     ...opts,","-    modulesDir: (manifest.name ? projectConfigRecord?.[manifest.name]?.modulesDir : undefined) ?? opts.modulesDir,","+    modulesDir: resolveModulesDir(manifest.name),","     lockfileDir: rootDir,","   })","   if (determineReportAs(opts) === 'json') {","@@ -62,6 +70,31 @@ export async function listRecursive (","   return outputs.join(joiner)"," }"," ","+export async function whyRecursive (","+  pkgs: Project[],","+  params: string[],","+  opts: Omit<WhyOptions, 'lockfileDir'> & Pick<Config, 'lockfileDir' | 'packageConfigs